Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.19,0:00:13.18,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.40,0:00:16.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Cecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Grant me the power I seek...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:18.46,0:00:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! You have to end this now!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.79,0:00:22.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Bell!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.27,0:00:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That light...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Demon Lord!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.36,0:00:28.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is where you DIE!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.76,0:00:31.09,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hero—!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.71,0:00:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.42,0:00:41.89,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's our hero!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.17,0:00:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Peace will return to the land at last...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.42,0:00:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.54,0:00:48.65,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, what's happening?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.65,0:00:50.64,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Guess it's time to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.51,0:00:55.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was summoned from another world\Nto defeat the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.43,0:00:59.66,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I've done my job, I have to leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.66,0:01:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.83,0:01:02.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.54,0:01:06.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But... But then...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.96,0:01:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about our promise to get married\Nonce we defeated the Demon Lord?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.41,0:01:15.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not again...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.49,0:01:17.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't think that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.16,0:01:19.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just because you've been\Nsaying that since we met...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.43,0:01:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why not?! Do you hate me or something?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.63,0:01:23.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it's not that...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then marry me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.46,0:01:25.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Marry me! Marry me! Marry me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.67,0:01:32.44,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A female dark elf named Mariabell.\NI met her in another world, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.44,0:01:35.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she's slightly obsessed with me...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.80,0:01:37.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have much longer...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.12,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! If you disappear, Hinata, then I...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.12,0:01:45.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't make this difficult for Lord Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.76,0:01:46.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Cecil...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:46.97,0:01:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's right!\NLet's see him off with a smile!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.88,0:01:51.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,May...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.45,0:01:53.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.01,0:01:54.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.96,0:01:58.16,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It makes me sad that\NI have to leave you guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:58.16,0:02:00.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we'll meet again someday.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.42,0:02:04.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.75,0:02:10.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye, everyone! Until next time!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.28,0:02:11.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.93,0:02:13.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.28,0:02:14.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.99,0:02:17.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll find a way—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.16,0:02:31.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.95,0:02:39.05,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's been a month since I returned\Nfrom another world.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This will be on the test!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.42,0:02:44.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Things have gone completely back to normal.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.33,0:02:48.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A safe and peaceful daily life,\Njust like I wanted.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.92,0:02:50.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.44,0:02:54.43,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.43,0:02:56.43,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,S-Sunohara?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.36,0:02:58.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,U-Um, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.97,0:03:00.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sakura, we're leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.51,0:03:02.10,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:02.10,0:03:03.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.69,0:03:06.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Kay. See ya, Mochida.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.87,0:03:11.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good thing I got to buy\Na bunch of stuff on sale today.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.23,0:03:13.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm home—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.55,0:03:14.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Never mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.78,0:03:17.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's no one here anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.49,0:03:18.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.54,0:03:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HI-NA-TA!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.31,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wha—?! Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.79,0:03:53.31,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.62,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?! How did—
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.62,0:03:56.99,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.99,0:04:01.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata! Hinata! Hinata! Hinata! Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.45,0:04:03.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you miss me while I was gone?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.32,0:04:04.37,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You missed me, right?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.37,0:04:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I missed you so much,\NI thought I was gonna go crazy!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.21,0:04:10.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But everything's okay now.\NI'll never let you be all by yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.63,0:04:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If anything, we ought to grow\Nthe fruits of our love.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.83,0:04:15.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How many children do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.39,0:04:17.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, lemme breathe for a sec!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.23,0:04:19.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, how dominant of you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.26,0:04:21.93,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,N-No, wait...!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.93,0:04:23.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is perfect.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.34,0:04:25.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd want to do it right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.85,0:04:28.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm ready whenever you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.58,0:04:32.14,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Calm down!\NA-And please put some clothes on!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.14,0:04:35.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you came alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.58,0:04:38.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard that it takes many mages\Nand many years to pull off
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.07,0:04:40.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,traveling between worlds.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.07,0:04:40.34,Subtitle-Alt,,0,0,0,,Smells like Hinata!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.34,0:04:41.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you doing...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.28,0:04:48.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it didn't matter\Nbecause I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.58,0:04:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Peace returned to our world,\Nand everyone touted us as saviors...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.52,0:04:57.30,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it all seemed so boring to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.30,0:05:00.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt an awful emptiness inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.90,0:05:04.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This life means nothing to me\Nwithout you in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.03,0:05:07.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As long as I've got you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.56,0:05:09.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the only thing I need.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.31,0:05:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't allow anything to stand\Nin the way of the love we share.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.29,0:05:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whether it's demon lords or\Nalternate dimensions,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.67,0:05:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd tear it all down just to reach you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:20.38,0:05:23.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be by your side for all eternity.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.74,0:05:24.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.74,0:05:26.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.74,0:05:29.85,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.75,0:05:32.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.06,0:05:34.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sh-She's... intense.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.13,0:05:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, I can't take it any longer!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.29,0:05:40.55,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,B-Bell?! What's with you all of a sudden?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess "sudden" isn't\Nthe right word, but I still—
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.39,0:05:44.23,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.51,0:05:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used up all my strength\Nand magic to get here...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.79,0:05:51.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.15,0:05:54.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.27,0:05:59.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's food from my world,\Nso I wasn't sure if you'd like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.74,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's totally fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.74,0:06:03.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, you're the one who made it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.46,0:06:09.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Been a while since I last sat down\Nto eat with Bell like this...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.24,0:06:14.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Having someone to share my meals with\Nmakes me really happy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.97,0:06:20.69,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Despite things being peaceful and\Nsafe here, it's felt like living in a fog.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.05,0:06:25.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But when Bell appeared in my room,\Nthat fog vanished all at once.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.97,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came to visit me.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's my line, silly.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who's glad to see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.87,0:06:41.45,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember what I said earlier?\NI'll always be by your side, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.71,0:06:42.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Earlier...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.37,0:06:45.01,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Always?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.01,0:06:47.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, does that mean you\Nwant to live here?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.53,0:06:50.03,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course! You just figured that out?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.03,0:06:51.53,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, right...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.53,0:06:55.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't worry, Hinata!\NI'll help out around the house!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.58,0:06:58.77,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you can't say no if I've already\Nmade my decision!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.77,0:07:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell, you said the quiet part out loud...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.98,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, at any rate...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.98,0:07:06.94,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see... This hand goes here...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.76,0:07:11.19,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"I'm brand new to this, but I hope\Nyou'll take good care of me."
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.47,0:07:17.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Why are you laughing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.33,0:07:18.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-My bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.63,0:07:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You caught me off guard, that's all...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.38,0:07:23.20,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I heard it's what the people here say\Nbefore getting married!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.20,0:07:24.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I practiced and everything!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oof, I'm full.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.71,0:07:30.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could go for a nice hot bath\Nright around now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, and take your time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.82,0:07:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you have to come with me, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.88,0:07:35.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.79,0:07:38.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know how bathtubs work\Nin your world.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.54,0:07:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, you had better hop in, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.36,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I mean, I can just show you...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.36,0:07:46.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Hinata. Please?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.34,0:07:47.76,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.37,0:07:55.56,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Too hot? Is it okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.56,0:07:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's perfect. That feels fantastic.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.33,0:07:59.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.59,0:08:02.70,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so sleek and smooth,\Nand I haven't even put anything in it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.70,0:08:04.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It slips through my fingers like silk.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.29,0:08:07.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm very proud of my hair.\NI get it from my mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.28,0:08:13.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the other world, a dark elf's black hair\Nand tanned skin are said to be an ill omen...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I find that hard to believe.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.49,0:08:17.72,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful, and shiny.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.72,0:08:19.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like the full moon in the night sky.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.47,0:08:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez, kinda cheesy, don't you think?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.83,0:08:24.47,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I just...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.47,0:08:26.26,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the same as ever...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.26,0:08:29.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nobody's allowed to touch it\Nexcept for you, Hinata.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.51,0:08:32.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You do know you're special to me, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.22,0:08:35.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah... I'll start washing it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.76,0:08:38.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mm, that smells lovely.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.92,0:08:40.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There are all sorts of haircare products.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.82,0:08:42.86,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Should we go shopping\Nin town sometime soon?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.86,0:08:43.87,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.94,0:08:47.15,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it didn't need any conditioner...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.15,0:08:48.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.32,0:08:51.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, now it's my turn to wash yours!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.51,0:08:53.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?! No, I can do it—
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.49,0:08:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.91,0:09:00.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll scour every inch of your body\Nfor any built-up dirt or grime,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.17,0:09:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then I'll squeeze\Nevery last drop out of you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.71,0:09:04.52,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by "squeeze"?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.52,0:09:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're sweating.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.88,0:09:09.51,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We had better get you all cleaned up...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.26,0:09:19.27,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel woozy...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.27,0:09:20.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gonna fall...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.83,0:09:24.22,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?! Did you get lightheaded?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,P-Please, Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.38,0:09:28.84,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't take much more...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.34,0:09:32.49,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's your fault, y'know.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.49,0:09:36.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you look at me like that,\NI won't be able to hold back any longer...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.72,0:09:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh my...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.00,0:09:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You are in the mood, aren't you, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.79,0:09:47.02,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then I'll help myself...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.02,0:09:48.73,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No! Please, no more!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.73,0:09:50.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, wait—!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata, stay with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.82,0:09:57.39,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hinata. You're awake?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.90,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you in pain?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.30,0:10:02.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Hinata. I shouldn't have\Ngotten carried away...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.50,0:10:06.32,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I should've paid more attention.\NIt wasn't your fault, Bell.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.32,0:10:07.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.91,0:10:10.24,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I like your hair, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.28,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mine?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.28,0:10:14.91,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! It's all fluffy...\Nand warm and toasty...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.91,0:10:16.82,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of sunlight.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.82,0:10:18.78,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-Thanks...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.49,0:10:21.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hinata?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.06,0:10:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you compared my hair\Nto the night sky...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.13,0:10:28.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but without the Sun,\Nthe Moon can't shine on its own.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.83,0:10:30.06,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bell...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.06,0:10:37.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, y'see... That's why I can never,\Never, EVER let you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.07,0:10:38.34,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.34,0:10:40.81,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I were to lose you again, Hinata...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.81,0:10:43.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,well, I don't know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Kay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.30,0:10:50.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A female dark elf named Mariabell.\NI met her in another world, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:51.20,0:10:53.59,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she's slightly obsessed with me...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.59,0:10:58.07,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But she's a very pure-hearted girl,\Nand very cute.
